# The reader's rest: a novel in GB18030 read as the Android app reads it (its words, not replacement marks); 排版 → 宋体
# (the serif face, kept in the core's prefs); 下载 in its top bar first (the bars shown by a tap): the whole
# file kept on the device.
#before drive-gb {T}
#env MBUI_OPEN_PAGE=files
timeout 90000
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 旧小说-gb.txt
tap 旧小说-gb.txt
until 读出来的字应当和写进去的一样
shot 1-read
tapxy 195 420
until icon:download
tap icon:download
until 已保存到「下载」
shot 2-saved
until 排版
tap 排版
until 宋体
tap 宋体
wait 800
shot 3-serif
